MODULE config

FUNCTION locate base directory
    prefer a configuration file beside the executable
    otherwise use a configuration file in the current directory for go run
    otherwise report both expected locations

FUNCTION load settings from base directory
    open portprog.conf as UTF-8 line-oriented text
    ignore blank and comment lines
    require each remaining line to contain one documented key and value
    reject unknown, duplicate, missing, or malformed settings
    require schema version 1, a valid default-profile identifier, positive
        numeric limits, limits that cannot overflow their runtime units, and a
        request timeout no longer than one day
    require every configured path to be a relative child path
    return validated settings including the base directory

FUNCTION explain settings
    return every required setting with its effective value and user-facing
        instructions for changing it
